WEBVTT

00:28.653 --> 00:29.779
Hey.

00:31.531 --> 00:37.537
The reason why you hate me so much is cuz
I dropped a washtub on your head, right?

00:38.329 --> 00:40.915
I have no intention
of being chummy with you.

00:40.999 --> 00:43.168
But I don't feel like
being enemies, either.

00:44.294 --> 00:46.045
I went a bit too far that time.

00:46.129 --> 00:46.963
Sorry.

00:51.426 --> 00:52.469
So you, too.

00:52.552 --> 00:56.014
Apologize to Okarun
since you made fun of him.

00:56.097 --> 00:57.807
Then we'll call it even, okay?

00:59.559 --> 01:02.062
You really don't get it at all,
Momo Ayase.

01:04.731 --> 01:07.817
I wouldn't call you my sworn enemy
because of a washtub.

01:07.901 --> 01:11.905
I'm after you because I'm positive
that you're a demon!

01:16.034 --> 01:17.952
I told you that I wasn't!

01:18.036 --> 01:21.539
You're nothing but trouble if you poke
at me because of a misunderstanding!

01:21.623 --> 01:23.416
Then what the hell is he?!

01:24.751 --> 01:29.881
Takakura-kun fighting Acrobatic Silky
looked just like a demon.

01:29.964 --> 01:30.924
Besides!

01:31.466 --> 01:34.511
There's no way she's your grandmother!

01:34.594 --> 01:36.846
She's too pretty and way too young!

01:36.930 --> 01:38.473
What's that?

01:38.556 --> 01:40.058
She's a really good girl!

01:40.141 --> 01:41.309
Yeah, Momo is a demon.

01:41.392 --> 01:45.021
You shut up, Grandma!
You're complicating things!

01:45.104 --> 01:46.272
I knew it.

01:47.148 --> 01:49.818
Takakura-kun and Auntie are demons.

01:49.901 --> 01:52.237
And you're the big boss in charge of them!

01:52.320 --> 01:55.198
You're trying to destroy the world, I bet.

01:58.409 --> 02:00.245
Are you a total idiot?!

02:00.328 --> 02:03.331
If I had such powers, I'd start off
by blowing your head off!

02:03.414 --> 02:05.291
Don't go daydreaming
like some eighth grader!

02:09.087 --> 02:10.755
Blow my head off?

02:10.839 --> 02:12.507
Now you're showing your true colors!

02:12.590 --> 02:15.135
Right now, I don't have
enough power to beat you.

02:15.218 --> 02:17.929
But I'm sure I'll become stronger
and beat you!

02:18.555 --> 02:20.265
Sounds great! Try me if you can!

02:20.348 --> 02:22.475
I'll beat you to a pulp!

02:23.935 --> 02:28.273
Sounds like you underestimate me,
but you're forgetting one thing.

02:28.356 --> 02:31.985
I have been chosen to protect world peace!

02:32.610 --> 02:34.696
Because I'm just too cute!

02:36.156 --> 02:37.282
Thanks for having me!

02:37.365 --> 02:39.409
The somen noodles were tasty, Auntie!

02:39.492 --> 02:43.037
Hold on, damn you!
I'm not done talking to you!

02:43.121 --> 02:46.708
Keep trying hard, Aira. Blow Momo away!

02:47.292 --> 02:49.085
Auntie here is cheering for you.

02:49.168 --> 02:52.380
Damn it, Grandma!
Why are you rooting for her?

02:52.463 --> 02:53.256
Huh?

02:54.215 --> 02:55.466
Takakura-kun.

02:57.760 --> 03:02.599
Despite being a demon,
you tried to save me multiple times.

03:03.725 --> 03:04.809
Why?

03:06.561 --> 03:08.229
It's because he's not a demon!

03:10.857 --> 03:12.692
I have no reason.

03:12.775 --> 03:15.361
If someone's in trouble,
you'd help them, wouldn't you?

03:17.322 --> 03:19.032
I see.

03:19.115 --> 03:23.119
You still have a human heart left in you.

03:23.202 --> 03:27.707
I will make sure to liberate you
from Momo Ayase's control!

03:35.715 --> 03:37.634
Hey! What was that?

03:37.717 --> 03:39.886
She's got a tremendous misunderstanding.

03:39.969 --> 03:42.430
There's something
seriously wrong with her!

03:43.431 --> 03:45.934
This feeling is so wrong.

03:46.017 --> 03:49.812
I'm a human, and he's a demon.

03:50.772 --> 03:52.523
It's wrong!

05:24.824 --> 05:25.908
Hold on!

05:25.992 --> 05:27.994
Can't you do this a bit more normally?!

05:28.077 --> 05:30.705
Quit your whining.

05:30.788 --> 05:32.915
I'm putting yer ball back in for ya.

05:34.167 --> 05:36.419
Let's play a tight game!

05:38.880 --> 05:42.884
- And why're you trying to bat?
- Pitcher's jittery! Hey, hey, hey!

05:42.967 --> 05:45.887
Jittery? Who're ya talkin' to?

05:48.181 --> 05:51.809
When you see my Turbo Granny Ball...

05:51.893 --> 05:55.480
you won't be spoutin' such nonsense!

05:57.065 --> 05:59.275
Such cheeky talk!

06:10.328 --> 06:11.871
Strike! Batter out!

06:11.954 --> 06:14.665
When a ball strikes your nuts,
ya gotta jump!

06:14.749 --> 06:17.251
No!

06:17.335 --> 06:19.462
So? Is it back in there?

06:19.545 --> 06:21.422
It's back!

06:21.506 --> 06:24.133
I have one ball back!

06:24.217 --> 06:25.593
- Hurray!
- All right!

06:25.676 --> 06:28.179
That pitch was high and inside.

06:28.262 --> 06:29.388
I'll hit it next time.

06:29.472 --> 06:31.849
Smokin' ball, huh?

06:31.933 --> 06:35.103
Good for you, Okarun.
You got a testicle back.

06:35.186 --> 06:36.646
It's so embarrassing!

06:37.230 --> 06:38.606
That aside...

06:38.689 --> 06:42.318
We have no clues for the other one.

06:42.401 --> 06:43.402
You're right.

06:43.486 --> 06:45.780
Okarun, you don't have a computer?

06:45.863 --> 06:47.865
Can't you look at occult forums
or something?

06:48.491 --> 06:50.743
I'm sorry, I don't have one.

06:50.827 --> 06:53.871
Guess I'll add more part-time jobs
and buy a smartphone.

06:53.955 --> 06:57.208
A four-year loan is a serious rip-off.

06:57.291 --> 06:59.752
So I'll see you on the roof during lunch?

07:01.546 --> 07:05.424
U-Um, I'm sorry, Miss Ayase.

07:06.884 --> 07:09.846
I'd like to work on a report during lunch.

07:10.513 --> 07:13.224
Oh. I see.

07:13.850 --> 07:15.977
Wanna head to an internet café
after school?

07:16.060 --> 07:19.689
I'm sorry. I also have
something after school.

07:23.109 --> 07:25.653
All right. I get it.

07:27.738 --> 07:29.574
I'm starving.

07:29.657 --> 07:31.659
Let's eat together!

07:31.742 --> 07:33.369
Huh? Where's Okarun?

07:33.453 --> 07:35.121
He said he's working on a report.

07:35.204 --> 07:37.540
So noble! Maybe I'll have him
work on mine, too.

07:37.623 --> 07:39.542
Okarun is so serious.

07:41.836 --> 07:45.339
But it's kinda suspicious.

07:45.423 --> 07:46.757
Huh? What's that?

07:46.841 --> 07:49.677
It's like totally obvious
that he's hiding something.

07:49.760 --> 07:52.430
A scent of a woman?

07:52.513 --> 07:53.890
No.

07:53.973 --> 07:58.269
Okarun's the last person
I'd suspect that, but...

07:59.854 --> 08:02.732
Nah. It couldn't be.

08:03.524 --> 08:05.151
I'm gonna go buy a drink.

08:05.234 --> 08:08.529
Then can you get me one, too? A Pompy.

08:13.242 --> 08:15.536
POMPY ORANGE

08:17.163 --> 08:18.706
What is this?

08:19.999 --> 08:22.710
I feel so uneasy.

08:23.294 --> 08:26.088
Should I peek into Class C?

08:27.673 --> 08:29.634
No, I don't want to bother him.

08:30.301 --> 08:32.845
He's writing a report after all.

08:52.573 --> 08:58.621
Fourteen... Fifteen... Sixteen...
Seventeen... Eighteen...

08:58.704 --> 09:01.332
Nineteen... Twenty.

09:05.253 --> 09:07.004
I'm no good like this.

09:07.088 --> 09:09.966
As I look for my golden ball,

09:10.550 --> 09:15.221
I'm sure another dangerous monster
will show up, and I'll have to fight it.

09:19.141 --> 09:23.729
Push-ups, sit-ups,
back extensions, and squats.

09:24.480 --> 09:26.274
Five sets, 100 reps each.

09:26.357 --> 09:29.527
I have to become strong. A lot stronger.

09:30.319 --> 09:35.157
If I don't, I'll be putting
Miss Ayase in harm's way.

09:35.241 --> 09:36.325
Takakura-kun.

09:40.329 --> 09:41.872
Miss Shiratori.

09:44.500 --> 09:47.128
D-Do you need something?

09:47.962 --> 09:51.257
You're a demon, and I'm a human.

09:52.216 --> 09:54.343
I know that it will never be...

09:54.427 --> 09:56.554
I'm not a demon, though.

09:57.138 --> 09:59.390
I can't hold back how I feel!

09:59.473 --> 10:01.934
Takakura-kun! You just stay still!

10:02.018 --> 10:03.144
- Huh? What the...
- Don't move.

10:03.227 --> 10:05.438
- Just close your eyes.
- But...

10:14.238 --> 10:15.072
Hey!

10:15.156 --> 10:18.075
Why are you dodging me?
You're so weird, Takakura-kun!

10:18.159 --> 10:18.993
Wait.

10:19.076 --> 10:20.828
You're the weird one!

10:20.911 --> 10:22.538
Why would you do that out of the blue?

10:22.622 --> 10:23.664
I mean...

10:23.748 --> 10:26.667
I mean, when you confess your love,
you have to kiss that person, right?

10:26.751 --> 10:28.878
- Huh?!
- It said so in a book!

10:28.961 --> 10:31.547
That confessing equals a kiss!

10:31.631 --> 10:35.009
And that it's the responsibility
of the guy to accept that confession!

10:35.092 --> 10:38.429
That's a mistake!
What did you use as your reference?

10:38.512 --> 10:40.222
U-Um...

10:40.306 --> 10:42.224
It was the one in Dad's study!

10:42.308 --> 10:44.685
That's something completely different!

10:45.269 --> 10:48.356
Miss Shiratori, you're totally popular
with all the boys.

10:48.439 --> 10:50.816
Why are you acting like
you're an amateur in relationships?

10:50.900 --> 10:52.610
- You like mature lips?
- I didn't say that!

10:53.402 --> 10:55.112
Can you stop this?

10:55.196 --> 10:57.615
A popular girl
shouldn't be doing something like this.

10:57.698 --> 10:59.867
Don't equate popularity and romance!

10:59.950 --> 11:01.786
You don't know the effort
behind popularity!

11:01.869 --> 11:04.497
And I'm not an amateur in relationships!

11:04.580 --> 11:06.707
I just don't know about them!
Don't mock me!

11:06.791 --> 11:09.210
That's exactly who the phrase describes!

11:09.293 --> 11:11.962
And right now,
you've got every last thing wrong!

11:12.505 --> 11:16.759
I've never felt this way before.
Let me confess!

11:16.842 --> 11:19.095
A-Are you insane?!

11:19.178 --> 11:20.930
Or are you possessed by something again?

11:21.013 --> 11:22.890
Hold on, Miss Shiratori.

11:52.920 --> 11:54.380
Um, uh...

11:54.463 --> 11:55.881
Takakura-kun.

11:56.507 --> 11:57.800
Hurry up.

12:01.846 --> 12:03.264
No, wait. This is...

12:03.347 --> 12:05.850
Why you little turd...

12:08.602 --> 12:10.312
Miss Ayase! You got it wrong!

12:10.396 --> 12:12.398
This is nothing like what you think.

12:12.481 --> 12:14.775
You said you were
going to work on a report,

12:14.859 --> 12:17.111
but you're making out with that damn girl.

12:17.194 --> 12:19.697
You took your jacket off
and you're even sweating.

12:19.780 --> 12:21.740
What's that on your arms?
Part of your kinky play?

12:21.824 --> 12:23.742
I have reasons for all of this!

12:23.826 --> 12:26.454
I don't want to hear excuses.

12:26.537 --> 12:27.955
Was the report thing a lie?

12:28.038 --> 12:29.999
T-That was a lie.

12:30.082 --> 12:31.584
I've had enough.

12:31.667 --> 12:33.919
But there's a reason for--

12:34.003 --> 12:35.754
I said, I've had enough!

12:40.342 --> 12:42.178
POMPY ORANGE

12:44.597 --> 12:46.182
Where's my Pompy?

12:46.265 --> 12:47.808
I gave it to the ground.

12:47.892 --> 12:49.560
What's that? A new gag?

12:50.144 --> 12:51.437
They didn't have any?

12:52.229 --> 12:56.358
- Hold on. I'm thinking right now.
- Huh?

12:56.442 --> 12:59.653
A mantis shrimp's punches
clock at 80 kilometers per hour.

12:59.737 --> 13:02.114
It has a force of roughly 150 kilograms.

13:02.698 --> 13:05.242
If you scale it to human size,
it's roughly 700 tons.

13:05.326 --> 13:07.703
You can defeat elephants
with such a punch.

13:07.786 --> 13:10.331
It's this effective underwater
with all that resistance.

13:10.998 --> 13:14.502
How destructive do you think it'd be
if it was unleashed in air?

13:15.085 --> 13:16.921
Actually, that's still an unknown.

13:17.796 --> 13:20.299
A mantis shrimp is thought
to hold back on its punches while in air.

13:20.382 --> 13:25.387
I see, I see. You too have times when
you simply want to punch something.

13:25.471 --> 13:27.473
She just talked to a mantis shrimp!

13:27.556 --> 13:29.725
She's got it pretty bad.

13:40.444 --> 13:41.946
There is...

13:42.029 --> 13:43.572
...no mistake.

13:43.656 --> 13:46.534
She's been possessed
by the spirit of a mantis shrimp!

13:48.202 --> 13:49.995
Miss Ayase is right about this.

13:50.871 --> 13:52.623
It's pointless to make excuses.

13:53.415 --> 13:56.835
If I'd gotten stronger without
her knowing, I thought it'd be kinda cool.

13:56.919 --> 13:58.671
I even made an effort to lie.

13:59.380 --> 14:01.131
I've sown the seeds myself.

14:01.757 --> 14:03.425
If I care about Miss Ayase,

14:04.176 --> 14:06.512
I shouldn't make excuses,
and just get stronger!

14:21.652 --> 14:23.696
Hey! Is anyone here?!

14:26.949 --> 14:27.950
Miss Shiratori!

14:28.492 --> 14:29.410
Takakura-kun!

14:30.536 --> 14:32.663
Miss Shiratori, where's everyone else?

14:32.746 --> 14:34.039
What's going on?

14:34.123 --> 14:37.418
It's pitch black outside the windows.
What happened?

14:37.918 --> 14:40.379
Can this be Momo Ayase's doing?

14:41.338 --> 14:43.632
Come to think, where's Miss Ayase?

14:45.009 --> 14:46.302
Miss Ayase, are you in here?

14:47.845 --> 14:48.846
She's not here.

14:50.723 --> 14:54.393
This feeling... I've experienced
something similar in the past.

14:58.981 --> 15:01.901
Damn it. I'm completely locked in.

15:02.902 --> 15:05.279
This seriously sucks!

15:05.362 --> 15:07.364
The water level is rising, too!

15:08.157 --> 15:10.743
I wonder what happened to Okarun.

15:10.826 --> 15:12.328
Or is this only happening to me?

15:12.411 --> 15:16.123
Sheesh! When I think about him,
I get so pissed off!

15:16.206 --> 15:18.042
What's up with this water, anyway?!

15:25.049 --> 15:26.091
What the...

15:28.802 --> 15:31.096
Something's totally approaching.

16:01.961 --> 16:04.546
What is that? A dinosaur?

17:52.446 --> 17:55.199
Sheesh! Is Okarun not here?

17:57.493 --> 17:59.787
What was that sound?

17:59.870 --> 18:02.790
I don't know.
But it sounded like an explosion.

18:02.873 --> 18:05.334
Hey, what exactly
is this situation we're in?

18:05.417 --> 18:08.128
Are you and Momo Ayase trying to frame me?

18:08.212 --> 18:11.632
Of course not.
I'd like to ask what's going on myself.

18:11.715 --> 18:14.968
But something similar to this
happened in the past.

18:15.677 --> 18:20.432
It was pitch black outside,
and we were completely walled in.

18:20.516 --> 18:22.810
What did you do back then?

18:22.893 --> 18:26.480
Well, when we defeated the alien,
it went back to normal.

18:26.563 --> 18:27.773
Alien?

18:27.856 --> 18:30.943
Hold on a second. Aliens exist?

18:31.026 --> 18:32.111
They do!

18:32.194 --> 18:34.655
To be honest, they're even worse
than yokai monsters!

18:34.738 --> 18:37.866
Huh? Then why do aliens assault us?

18:37.950 --> 18:39.701
Well, I don't know.

18:40.369 --> 18:44.748
It seemed like they were collecting
human reproductive organs.

18:47.835 --> 18:52.339
Chiquitita, you have a dream?

18:52.422 --> 18:55.926
Chi-Chiquitita, Chi-Chiquitita-chi.

18:56.009 --> 18:58.971
Chiquitita. Chiquitita, you have a dream?

18:59.054 --> 19:02.349
Chi-Chiquitita, Chi-Chi-Chiquitita.

19:02.432 --> 19:04.434
Chi-Chi-Chiquitita. S-Shy--

19:04.518 --> 19:06.103
This makes me wilt.

19:06.186 --> 19:08.647
Chi-Chiquitita, Chi-Chi-Chiquitita...

19:08.730 --> 19:10.482
Man, what a bother.

19:10.566 --> 19:15.571
It's impossible for me to protect a girl.

19:15.654 --> 19:18.198
Chi-Chiquitita.
S-Shy my chotchiki for you.

19:18.282 --> 19:21.535
Aira-chan. You're in the way, so get lost.

19:21.618 --> 19:23.287
"A-Aira-chan"?

19:23.370 --> 19:26.123
We haven't even kissed yet.
Don't call me that!

19:26.206 --> 19:29.084
- Uh, morning, noon, and night.
- I feel so droopy.

19:29.168 --> 19:33.380
We're gig workers.

19:37.509 --> 19:39.011
Takakura-kun!

19:41.889 --> 19:45.058
We finally meet, man person.

19:45.767 --> 19:48.604
Serpoians.

19:48.687 --> 19:49.980
Hold on, you guys!

19:50.063 --> 19:51.773
Get away from him!

19:51.857 --> 19:53.609
I will take you on!

19:53.692 --> 19:55.944
Miss Shiratori, run for it!

19:56.028 --> 19:59.781
These guys target women!

20:02.784 --> 20:04.161
Miss Shiratori!

20:04.244 --> 20:10.042
We adjusted this void space so that only
those with high spirituality can enter.

20:10.125 --> 20:11.960
Is the apparatus malfunctioning?

20:12.044 --> 20:16.423
We came here because we want your banana.

20:16.506 --> 20:17.883
We want it.

20:17.966 --> 20:19.343
We want it.

20:19.426 --> 20:20.802
Damn it!

20:20.886 --> 20:24.139
Why is everything after my junk?

20:24.223 --> 20:26.600
Because it's something good.

20:26.683 --> 20:32.105
You have an amazing power
that surpasses our scientific technology.

20:32.731 --> 20:35.275
We want your powers.

20:35.359 --> 20:37.444
We'd love to experiment on you...

20:37.527 --> 20:40.906
...and transplant your powers to us.

20:40.989 --> 20:43.867
That power comes from a curse.

20:43.951 --> 20:46.703
It's not my own power
or anything like that!

20:46.787 --> 20:50.582
I personally have less physical power
than the average person!

20:51.083 --> 20:55.087
Curse? What kind of
banana condition is that?

20:55.170 --> 20:56.129
Like I'd know!

20:57.256 --> 21:00.550
Damn it. I can't transform at all.

21:00.634 --> 21:04.304
It feels like when Miss Ayase is holding
back the curse with her psychic powers.

21:14.856 --> 21:16.692
Then let's get to it...

21:16.775 --> 21:18.568
...and perform the operation.

21:19.736 --> 21:22.990
First, let us cut off the banana.

21:24.324 --> 21:25.492
Stop it!

21:25.575 --> 21:28.996
I still only have one testicle!

21:41.508 --> 21:46.221
It seems that
I am the chosen one after all.

21:53.562 --> 21:56.940
Let go of Takakura-sama!

23:28.740 --> 23:30.784
I'm human, and he's a demon.

23:30.867 --> 23:33.829
I know it's wrong,
but I can't hold these feelings back.

23:33.912 --> 23:37.165
I'm going to save Takakura-sama from the
hands of the evil boss demon, Momo Ayase!

23:37.249 --> 23:38.458
I told you, you're wrong!

23:38.542 --> 23:41.336
Next episode,
"Merge! Serpo Dover Demon Nessie!"

23:41.419 --> 23:42.170
Listen to me!
